---

<Layout title="Bật để tiết kiệm điện">
  <div class="flex overflow-hidden flex-col w-full bg-white">
    <div class="flex flex-col w-full"></div>
    <div
      class="flex gap-2 items-center px-4 py-3 w-full text-lg font-semibold leading-loose text-white bg-black"
    >
      <div class="self-stretch my-auto">Mở bộ lọc</div>
      <img
        loading="lazy"
        src="https://cdn.builder.io/api/v1/image/assets/098ebfbb07384cf89eeedb3d40701deb/a6315f7a5cf07bef4943e88a3fc384a678393010b5f84466b6e037750457d8b0?apiKey=098ebfbb07384cf89eeedb3d40701deb&"
        class="object-contain shrink-0 self-stretch my-auto w-6 aspect-square"
      />
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col px-6 py-8 w-full">
      <div class="text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight leading-9 text-black">
        Các dự án Eliton
        <br />
        đã thực hiện
      </div>
      <div class="mt-4 text-sm leading-5 text-black text-opacity-60">
        Eliton đã triển khai nhiều dự án thành công, mang lại sự hài lòng cho
        khách hàng với các giải pháp tiết kiệm điện năng và hiệu quả. Các dự án
        của chúng tôi bao gồm các hệ thống điện năng lượng mặt trời, hệ thống
        chiếu sáng thông minh và các giải pháp tự động hóa nhà ở.
      </div>
      <div class="flex gap-2 items-center mt-4 w-full">
        <div
          class="flex overflow-hidden gap-2.5 items-center self-stretch p-2 my-auto w-7 h-7 bg-black rounded-lg"
        >
          <img
            loading="lazy"
            src="https://cdn.builder.io/api/v1/image/assets/098ebfbb07384cf89eeedb3d40701deb/725d23db755538a1b701b0660255c71160375c5fedadae676b10257bea489982?apiKey=098ebfbb07384cf89eeedb3d40701deb&"
            class="object-contain w-3 aspect-square"
          />
        </div>
        <div
          class="flex overflow-hidden gap-2.5 items-center self-stretch p-2 my-auto w-7 h-7 bg-black rounded-lg"
        >
          <img
            loading="lazy"
            src="https://cdn.builder.io/api/v1/image/assets/098ebfbb07384cf89eeedb3d40701deb/df6264ae4bd954afcce8bba04b97ba51a942995bd769db09af77ca1df99dfae5?apiKey=098ebfbb07384cf89eeedb3d40701deb&"
            class="object-contain w-3 aspect-square"
          />
        </div>
        <div
          class="flex overflow-hidden gap-2.5 items-center self-stretch p-2 my-auto w-7 h-7 bg-black rounded-lg"
        >
          <img
            loading="lazy"
            src="https://cdn.builder.io/api/v1/image/assets/098ebfbb07384cf89eeedb3d40701deb/a7303e9c82ded8fffdf05068822e3da3daab77011cb65d08078b3744f37ffa85?apiKey=098ebfbb07384cf89eeedb3d40701deb&"
            class="object-contain w-3 aspect-square"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col items-center w-full p-6">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 w-full">
        {projects.map((project) => (
          <div class="flex overflow-hidden flex-col mt-5 w-full bg-gray-100 rounded-xl">
            <img
              loading="lazy"
              srcset={`${project.imageUrl}&width=100 100w, ${project.imageUrl}&width=200 200w, ${project.imageUrl}&width=400 400w, ${project.imageUrl}&width=800 800w, ${project.imageUrl}&width=1200 1200w, ${project.imageUrl}&width=1600 1600w, ${project.imageUrl}&width=2000 2000w`}
              class="object-contain w-full aspect-square"
            />
            <div class="flex flex-col px-6 pb-6 mt-4 w-full">
              <div class="flex flex-col w-full">
                <div class="text-lg font-semibold text-black">
                  {project.title}
                </div>
                <div class="text-sm leading-5 text-black text-opacity-60">
                  {project.description}
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex flex-col mt-3 w-full text-sm font-medium leading-none text-black">
                {project.details.map((detail) => (
                  <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 content-center items-center p-1.5 mt-1.5 w-full bg-zinc-500 bg-opacity-10">
                    <div class="flex flex-1 shrink gap-2 items-center self-stretch my-auto basis-0 ">
                      <img
                        loading="lazy"
                        src={detail.icon}
                        class="object-contain shrink-0 self-stretch my-auto w-5 aspect-square"
                      />
                      <div class="self-stretch my-auto">{detail.label}</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="self-stretch my-auto">{detail.value}</div>
                  </div>
                ))}
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
      <div
        class="flex overflow-hidden gap-2 justify-center items-center self-stretch px-20 py-2 mt-5 w-full text-sm font-semibold text-black bg-white"
      >
        <div class="self-stretch my-auto">Xem thêm</div>
        <img
          loading="lazy"
          src="https://cdn.builder.io/api/v1/image/assets/098ebfbb07384cf89eeedb3d40701deb/8ea94ae1d5b22d37f66ec0fa7dc0d0e8ab995177fa117904dd4a7042aa3bf1ba?apiKey=098ebfbb07384cf89eeedb3d40701deb&"
          class="object-contain shrink-0 self-stretch my-auto w-6 aspect-square"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col w-full"></div>
  </div>
</Layout>
